{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0294_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8ad8973a1586e499f6e051f2ea5f37b473eb3358587c212ce908d1a5f74934c7", "ja": "（今日はブライダル雑誌のモデルの仕事だ。最初は\n苦戦していた昴だが、次第に調子を取り戻してきた）", "zh": "（今天是拍摄婚礼杂志模特照的工作。昴一开始还颇为吃力，但渐渐找回了状态。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0294_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "ca26159fa96093c9a00b95250de463c9dc1f9807987a1e3275fa58de727667d6", "ja": "ふぅ～。{$P$}、お疲れ！\n撮影も後半戦って感じだな！", "zh": "呼——{$P$}，辛苦啦！\n拍摄也感觉进入后半程了啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0294_1002_p", "source_sha256": "087ff121f7c36bb4b766712be9b4f4d47bffc2ed0cec63194c296c04850bd4e3", "ja": "お疲れ様、昴。そうだな。\n最初はどうなるかと思ったけど……。", "zh": "辛苦了，昴。是啊。\n刚开始还真不知道会变成什么样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0294_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "16ff167eb275fa925ce44cd1c82a60046d972bd84697f5b1cf9508cf3981c785", "ja": "うん。正直、オレもヒヤヒヤしたよ……。\nこのままうまく出来なかったらどうしようって。", "zh": "嗯，说实话，我也捏了把汗……。\n要是就这样没法顺利完成的话，该怎么办啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0294_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "6784db5cf94d99d3500b72c819abaa3820b99f8499ffe5bb3038391a29b4c652", "ja": "花嫁役のモデルの人とか、みんなキレイでさ。\nこういう撮影に慣れてる人も多かったみたいだし。", "zh": "演新娘的模特，还有其他人，全都很漂亮。好像很多人都很习惯这种拍摄。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0294_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "9208b5621f26c338a1811c1f81564fa65d6fd6ac1ee50a04548876bdcad741e6", "ja": "オレのせいで、撮影が止まるのはやだから、\nいろいろ考えてやったんだけど……。", "zh": "我可不想因为我的缘故让拍摄停下来，所以就想了很多办法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0294_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c55cf2a5b3aa51a1f2d27c1807e7205f170ee4f4c46fba58e97128bef33fc7b6", "ja": "そうだったんだな。撮影に慣れた人がいたら、\n昴もやりやすいかと思ったんだけど……ごめんな。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。我想着要是有熟悉拍摄的人在，昴也能更轻松一些……对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0294_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "6d6ee0432e4441a369fd63c7fd17a62535d6397d7e7e0693f12ffa26dbe782aa", "ja": "いいよ、気にしてない！　むしろ謝るのはオレの方。\nワガママいって、撮影の予定変えちゃったし。", "zh": "没事啦，我完全没介意！不如说该道歉的是我才对。\n是我任性，才把拍摄日程都给改了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0294_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c55d7bc482db8aa89288b296b267c9864c8eb0944ac80bde320fe1035db33af3", "ja": "「外で撮影したい」って言われた時は驚いたけど……\nすごくいい写真になってるよ。", "zh": "听你说“想在外面拍摄”的时候，我确实吓了一跳，不过……\n照片拍得非常棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0294_1009_p", "source_sha256": "06d892d160fa54b72be0b01458bb962534a22c32af21627fb244f34b0afac7ac", "ja": "でも、どうして場所を変えようと思ったんだ？", "zh": "不过，你为什么会想换个地方呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0294_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "df6d1c2fbdcda7669330eab4c61c80672ff28076b0da9f5afd62fc90535ca47c", "ja": "なんか変な風に考えててさ。花嫁さんらしくしなきゃ、\n他のモデルさんみたいにしなきゃって。", "zh": "我就是想得有点奇怪。总觉得得像个新娘才行，得像其他模特那样才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0294_1011_047sub", "source_sha256": "88142c648f0224a90022ee769ae3f397e10fe7aa073017eddc2d3ab1eb1017a1", "ja": "休憩の時に外の空気吸ったら、スッキリしてさ。\n外で撮ったら、気持ちよさそうだなって思ったんだ。", "zh": "休息的时候到外面呼吸了新鲜空气，感觉神清气爽的。我就想，要是在外面拍照，应该会很舒服吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0294_1012_p", "source_sha256": "f0f545c200997897abbfd1933a6f9f3177314c4c7e37f4b319d4861c86a6d5c0", "ja": "そういうことだったのか。\nうん、昴らしい元気な写真になってると思うよ。", "zh": "原来是这么回事啊。\n嗯，我觉得拍出了很有昴风格、充满活力的照片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0294_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "72df762676339e80743d88126912a8eb75989e2f6cb4138712c68209ec91f811", "ja": "へへっ♪　撮影してて、オレ思ったんだ。もしかしたら\nオレみたいに迷ってる花嫁さんもいるのかなって。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪　拍摄的时候，我就在想。说不定也有像我一样迷茫的新娘吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0294_1014_p", "source_sha256": "6162baa800447c175a74228578d64e69cd4c8af37f79a0fdd2b1b72ab2c14e92", "ja": "昴みたいな？", "zh": "像昴这样的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0294_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "844cb12bc48d0e06f3bf18ad205d74cd3d3c36b8328486e4ffdbc4f0c6cd9d08", "ja": "うん。花嫁さんはおしとやかじゃなきゃいけない\nって思ってる人、きっといると思うんだ。", "zh": "嗯。肯定会有人觉得，\n新娘子就非得温婉文静才行吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0294_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "dc81a38ed9ea4b4e83eef41f47c0e48a3963198a07ad4342c152c9ba775db20c", "ja": "でも式場の人が「花嫁は主役だ」って言っててさ。\nオレが主役なら、オレらしくないとって……。", "zh": "不过，婚礼会场的人说“新娘才是主角”来着。\n既然我是主角，那就得做最真实的自己……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0294_1017_047sub", "source_sha256": "878d278a885d42ca5d09c8aab523259ce434e2aa68edbe882cf9ff114ed64ef3", "ja": "えーっと、だから……いろいろ迷ってる人が、\nオレの写真で元気になってくれたらいいなってこと！", "zh": "呃，所以说……要是那些感到迷茫的人，能因为我的照片打起精神来就好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0294_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6cdc87ab05338c3a69566bd3d235cd2c4e6df95cee232d993bbff195faea5077", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\n写真を見た人に届くといいな、昴の思い。", "zh": "啊，是啊。\n希望昴的心意能传达给看到照片的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0294_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "050a0a32aef87796e672b818626ecd5320eb7ef633edc1183653f0b91cb6df4e", "ja": "うん！　ほんとはもっと動きたかったけど……\n写真じゃ伝わらないんだよなー。", "zh": "嗯！其实本来还想做更多动作的，可是……\n光靠照片传达不出我的心情啊——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0294_1020_p", "source_sha256": "00bdeb8bc017fe41a265d4175cdc4e558b9eafad27969cf5e0fe55325fe37686", "ja": "たしかに、動画だったら……。\nそうだな。メイキング映像ならいけるんじゃないか？", "zh": "确实，要是视频的话……  \n对了，要是制作花絮视频，说不定就行了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0294_1021_047sub", "source_sha256": "f508a05892ba81d7cc1e54fe09ebbfd7bb58ab571000b45639f06c02db85bac8", "ja": "どういうこと？", "zh": "是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0294_1022_p", "source_sha256": "d2ac7e0654f296ee86837a3ad5a5777c0467cf05207252c2a86cf6cf21c7f1b1", "ja": "動画なら、もっと昴の魅力が伝わるだろ？\n雑誌の宣伝で映像を使えないか、相談してみるよ！", "zh": "如果是视频的话，不是能更好地传达昴的魅力吗？\n我去商量一下，看看能不能用影像来宣传杂志！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0294_1023_047sub", "source_sha256": "be43007b787c891833a22936ed11d3a25aa3c9cffaead48d16f9397006fdc17b", "ja": "ほんとっ！？　それじゃ、オレももっと頑張らないと！\nもちろん、汚さないように気をつけながらな。えへへ♪", "zh": "真的！？那样的话，我也得更加努力才行！当然，也会注意别弄脏的。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0294_1024_p", "source_sha256": "11be290224aef15fca4e923dcea414d327cff523dfefaf70491669e6bbf701d6", "ja": "（昴の思いやりと元気な笑顔が、多くの花嫁の背中を\n押すことだろう。……よし、早速相談しに行こう！）", "zh": "（昴的体贴和活力满满的笑容，一定会为许多新娘加油打气吧。……好，马上去找她商量！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
